nalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037631","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:30:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163270-1846651706695788","game_id":"steam-4163270","kind":"update","title":"Demo small update: tweaks & fixes","summary":"A new demo update is live!GeneralNew main rival: Iowa. There's also now a chance some main rivals (e.g. Nirdox) won't spawn in a race, for more varietyNew \"Match cursor sensitivity\" button beside hand sensitivity: sets your hand sensitivity to match your desktop cursorSoundtracks: Adjusted EQ on some music tracks (Stadium and Factory) to sound more livelyBalanceSawed-Off and Rubberjumper: tighter pellet spread and sound adjustmentsPneumatic Servo: self-aligns more gently, so it fights your steer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:43:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695788","verified_at":"2026-10-21T03:57:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4163270-1846651706690930","game_id":"steam-4163270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now !","summary":"Start your engines, DEMO IS OUT !!!Featuring:A full roguelike run: a branching map 7 races long with 3 lives, objectives, and a shop between races.71 items to collect, each with unique abilities: use them to obliterate your enemies, gain lap time, or even turn back time.10 race setups across 5 tracks: Stadium, Forest, Winter Mountain, Fire Factory and Tokyo, each with its own weather or time of day, featuring mirrored and reversed layouts.15 Achievements to unlock.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690930","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","conte